/T (tooltip zref@5)
/TU (Operation process of CBR-PR intelligent decision-making system. Step 1. Enter the account password on the login interface to enter the system. Step 2, define the new process problem through text file import or direct input. Step 3, search and match the process case in the database that meets the set threshold, and output the case number to query the specific information of the case. Step 4: The satisfied case is not retrieved in step 3 or the retrieved case does not meet the processing requirements, and the key processing parameters are obtained through process reasoning. Step 5, determine the final processing plan. Step 6, input and evaluate the processing result of step 5, and then recycle the processing plan and processing result into a new process case and store it in the database.)
/Type /Annot
>>
